    Takes inputs: {'value': {'type': 'number', 'description': 'Monetary amount already in millions.'}, 'currency_code': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Source currency (ISO code).'}, 'year': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Fiscal year whose exchange rate should be applied.'}}
    Returns an output of type: number
